WEBVTT

00:14:59.009 --> 00:15:03.637
Mi-8 helicopters.

00:15:03.637 --> 00:15:07.546
Touchdown -- 3:14 and 48 seconds,

00:15:07.546 --> 00:15:09.021
a.m. Central Time.

00:15:09.021 --> 00:15:10.192
CH: And you roll to a stop

00:15:10.192 --> 00:15:11.861
as if someone threw your 
spaceship at the ground

00:15:11.861 --> 00:15:13.243
and it tumbles end over end,

00:15:13.243 --> 00:15:14.249
but you're ready for it

00:15:14.249 --> 00:15:15.625
you're in a custom-built seat,

00:15:15.625 --> 00:15:17.062
you know how the shock absorber works.

00:15:17.062 --> 00:15:19.053
And then eventually the Russians reach in,

00:15:19.053 --> 00:15:20.211
drag you out,

00:15:20.211 --> 00:15:21.911
plunk you into a chair,

00:15:21.911 --> 00:15:25.354
and you can now look back at

00:15:25.354 --> 00:15:28.536
what was an incredible experience.

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
You have taken the dreams of that